  "correct": "3",
  "solution": "The logic followed here is :-\n\nBy using BODMAS RULE :\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/4671232025562bc3ba9a781319d633acf8cd8e78dc8e96912cd7564a7df4717d.png] \n\nOption 1) : 10, 80, ÷, -\n\nGiven equation is : 15 ÷ 80 - 34 + 10 × 8 = 102\n\nAfter interchanging the two numbers and two signs the equation is as follows : 15 - 10 ÷ 34 + 80 × 8 = 102\n\n⇒ 15 - __**10 ÷ 34**__ + 80 × 8 = 102\n\n⇒ 15 - 0.29411 + __**80 × 8**__ = 102\n\n⇒ __**15**__ - 0.29411 __**+ 640**__ = 102\n\n⇒ __**655 - 0.29411**__ = 102\n\n⇒ 654.7058 ≠ 102\n\nLHS ≠ RHS\n\nOption 2) : 15, 34, -, ×\n\nGiven equation is : 15 ÷ 80 - 34 + 10 × 8 = 102\n\nAfter interchanging the two numbers and two signs the equation is as follows : 34 ÷ 80 × 15 + 10 - 8 = 102\n\n⇒ __**34 ÷ 80**__ × 15 + 10 - 8 = 102\n\n⇒ __**0.425 × 15**__ + 10 - 8 = 102\n\n⇒ __**6.375 + 10**__ - 8 = 102\n\n⇒ __**1**____**6.375 - 8**__ = 102\n\n⇒ 8.375 ≠ 102\n\nLHS ≠ RHS\n\nOption 3) : 34, 15, +, ÷\n\nGiven equation is : 15 ÷ 80 - 34 + 10 × 8 = 102\n\nAfter interchanging the two numbers and two signs the equation is as follows : 34 + 80 - 15 ÷ 10 × 8 = 102\n\n⇒ 34 + 80 - __**15 ÷ 10**__ × 8 = 102\n\n⇒ 34 + 80 - __**1.5 × 8**__ = 102\n\n⇒ __**34 + 80**__ - 12 = 102\n\n⇒ __**114 - 12**__ = 102\n\n⇒ **102 = 102**\n\n**LHS = RHS**\n\nOption 4) : 10, 34, ÷, ×\n\nGiven equation is : 15 ÷ 80 - 34 + 10 × 8 = 102\n\nAfter interchanging the two numbers and two signs the equation is as follows : 15 × 80 - 10 + 34 ÷ 8 = 102\n\n⇒ 15 × 80 - 10 + __**34 ÷ 8**__ = 102\n\n⇒ __**15 × 80**__ - 10 + 4.25 = 102\n\n⇒ __**1200**__ - 10 __**+ 4.25**__ = 102\n\n⇒ __**1204.25 - 10**__ = 102\n\n⇒ 1194.25 ≠ 102\n\nLHS ≠ RHS\n\nHence, the correct answer is** \"34, 15, +, ÷\".**",
